WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
You have 1,800 words.

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.100
Your subject: one religious
practice, experience or belief,

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.170
among real believers.

4
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.540
You might interview people,
observe, and even take part,

5
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.120
where you are welcome.

6
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:17.720
Before you go, you learn
the customs: what to wear,

7
00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:21.850
when to remove your shoes, and
to ask before taking photographs.

8
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.490
But it all starts with one choice.

9
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.190
How do you choose a question worth asking?

10
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.060
In this mission, you'll sort
sources into primary and secondary,

11
00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.880
and see why you need both.

12
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.250
Then you'll meet the five
headings your write-up must use,

13
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.720
and learn to set aside your
own judgements while you study.

14
00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:43.730
Your mission: find out how to
choose a question worth asking.
